<title>USA: Equus II Inc has $4.3 mln gain on sale.</title>
<headline>Equus II Inc has $4.3 mln gain on sale.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equus II Incorporated said Friday that it will record a $4.3 million capital gain on the sale of its investment in Industrial Equipment Rentals Inc to Neff Corp, a privately owned company which rents and sells construction equipment, for $6.7 million in cash.</p>
<p>The business development company, which trades as a closed-end fund on the American Stock Exchange, said it will realize the gain due to the sale in its third quarter results.</p>
